  "description": "RoboSystems calculation arcs for rs-gaap. Pure rs-gaap-on-rs-gaap: every parent and every child is a rs-gaap concept. Defines the reporting-layer calc DAG that turns mapped leaves into curated subtotals and the final NetIncomeLoss / Assets = LiabilitiesAndStockholdersEquity bottom lines. FAC structural anchors are out of the reporting layer; FAC's role is CoA classification only.",
